{"translation":{"id":"cmn_feb","name":"免费的易读圣经 Free Easy-to-read Bible","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmnfeb","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmnfeb","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"FEB","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: 免费的易读圣经 Free Easy-to-read Bible (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"281f45e9c6d64d9cf8e618e4fd7d2d961bebba0f46a534312de0f8ea52a83755","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/books.json","numberOfBooks":27,"totalNumberOfChapters":260,"totalNumberOfVerses":7959,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"2JN","translationId":"cmn_feb","name":"约翰二书","commonName":"约翰二书","title":"约翰二书","order":63,"numberOfChapters":1,"sha256":"24d8dff6e5137a1e99bb87447229a6f7311f8e26136bf17916a2e7bb6891beae","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/2JN/1.json","lastChapterNumber":1,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/2JN/1.json","totalNumberOfVerses":13},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["这封信来自长老",{"noteId":0},"，写给被选中的女士",{"noteId":1},"和她的儿女，都是我以真理所热爱的。不只是我，这封信也来自所有知道真理之人，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["因为这真理就生活在我们中间，将于我们永远同在。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["愿在真理和爱中, 来自父上帝和其子耶稣基督的恩典、怜悯和平安，持续与我们同在。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["很高兴看到你的一些儿女，就像天父命令我们那样，追寻真理。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["亲爱的女士，现在我要告诉你：我们应该彼此相爱。这并非是一条新指令，而是我们应该从一开始就要遵守的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["我们应该遵循上帝的命令，这就是爱。这命令正如你们最初听到的，你们应该生活在爱中。",{"noteId":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我告诉你们这些，是因为许多欺骗者已经离开，到外面的世界去了。他们不接受耶稣基督是以人的身份来的。任何像这样的人都是欺骗者和反基督者。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["你们要小心，不要丢掉我们如此努力完成的工作，也不要丢掉你应该得到的一切。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["那些变得极端的人，",{"noteId":3},"不在继续遵守基督的教导，上帝不会与之同在。遵循基督的教导，上帝和上帝之子都会与他们同在。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["如果有人来到你面前，没有展示基督教导的证据，不要接纳他们，也不要问候他；"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["因为你鼓励他们，就是等于参与了邪恶的事情。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我还有许多话想要说给你们听，但我不想用纸墨继续写下去，只是希望能造访你们，与你们当面谈谈，那样会让我们感到非常欢喜！"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["你那被选中姐妹的儿女向你问候。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"+","text":"这里被理解为约翰。","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":1}},{"noteId":1,"caller":"+","text":"“被选中的女士”可以指代某个教堂，或者某位特定的基督徒女士。第 13 节同样如此。","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":1}},{"noteId":2,"caller":"+","text":"或者“你应该这样做。”","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":6}},{"noteId":3,"caller":"+","text":"原意为“走得太远的人。”","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":9}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_feb/2JN/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/3JN/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/1JN/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}